{"ticker":"PRSMJOHNSN","symbol":"PRSMJOHNSN","instrumentId":3022566,"name":"Prism Johnson","industry":"NSE-Bldg-Cement/Concrt/Ag","about":"Prism Johnson Ltd. is one of India’s largest integrated building materials companies, offering a diverse range of products, including cement, ready-mixed concrete (RMC), tiles, and bath products. The company operates across four key segments: Cement, Tile and Bath (HRJ), Ready Mixed Concrete (RMC), and Insurance. Its Cement division produces Portland Pozzolana cement, catering to the construction industry, while the HRJ segment offers high-quality tiles, sanitaryware, and faucets. The RMC segment provides ready-mixed concrete for architectural and decorative uses. Additionally, Prism Johnson has a joint venture in the insurance sector, offering general insurance and reinsurance products. It emphasizes customer satisfaction and sustainable practices in all its operations.","website":"www.prismjohnson.in","location":"Hyderabad, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:50:37.258Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":109.79,"changePct":1.3664481580648176,"week52High":154.64,"week52Low":94.51},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹5,526 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹7,657 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"125,839,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"44"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"42,372,171"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.62"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"62.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.08"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.71"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"14.64"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"15–183"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"4.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"9.99"},{"label":"Volume","value":"99,530"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"308,769"},{"label":"Master score","value":"49"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"91"},{"